-- PART 4: the tilt verdict --
  The three SRH1 A1 tilt cases pass G1 here (0.073 / 0.072; 0.872 / 0.864; 2.475 / 2.427).
  The derived history H_A does not (9916.246 / 9008.690). So the gates cannot exclude the tilt:
  it was fitted to them. Verdict: TILT POST HOC, NOT EXCLUDED.

  PR-F4 is frozen in FROZEN_CRITERIA.md section 6 and is printed below in full. It decides the tilt
  with data that is not in this repository, so it is not run here.
